<http://data.silknow.org/object/d41aea75-f233-3fad-8590-4fc8040811af/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Silk shawl of woven silk with a small repeating pattern (5.125 inches x 4.125 inches) of a diagonal leaf enclosed by vertical and horizontal slim 'cone' shapes. There is a three inch border with a design of linked medallions. The weft is of bright pink, green, blue, cream, black and white on a deep pink warp. The shawl has a green selvedge and a purple warp fringe."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/d41aea75-f233-3fad-8590-4fc8040811af> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/d41aea75-f233-3fad-8590-4fc8040811af>
